<title>CANADA: DBRS assigns rating to Laidlaw debt.</title>
<headline>DBRS assigns rating to Laidlaw debt.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service Ltd said on Thursday that it assigned a BBB (high) rating to the unsecured debentures of Laidlaw Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has strong competitive positions in its existing operations, as well as stable profitability,&quot; the rating agency said.</p>
<p>The rating also recognized the favorable impact from Laidlaw's decision earlier this year to sell its solid waste business, DBRS said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
